{
  "id": "319",
  "title": "Ben’s Diary — Watching a Movie",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2017-06-02",
  "synopsis": "Ben writes in his diary about how he couldn’t go to the movies with Lili.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/433/18cde2d080920a29a0655ecdce05c2bff23833d3.mp3?1589790975",
  "series": {
    "title": "Ben’s life in China 1: Meeting Lili",
    "chapter": 23,
    "totalChapters": 29
  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "本的日记-看电影\n\n    今天我想和丽丽去看电影。我昨天买了电影票。但是丽丽今天去学校了，晚上10点才能回来。因为我们的电影是8点的，所以我们不能看电影了。我不太高兴。丽丽和我说“对不起”，我说“没关系”。",
    "traditional": "本的日記-看電影\n\n    今天我想和麗麗去看電影。我昨天買了電影票。但是麗麗今天去學校了，晚上10點才能回來。因為我們的電影是8點的，所以我們不能看電影了。我不太高興。麗麗和我說“對不起”，我說“沒關係”。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben’s Diary — Watching a Movie"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "今天我想和丽丽去看电影。",
      "traditional": "今天我想和麗麗去看電影。",
      "pinyin": "jīn tiān wǒ xiǎng hé lì lì qù kàn diàn yǐng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "我昨天买了电影票。",
      "traditional": "我昨天買了電影票。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ zuó tiān mǎi le diàn yǐng piào",
      "english": "Today I wanted to go to the movies with Lili."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "但是丽丽今天去学校了，晚上10点才能回来。",
      "traditional": "但是麗麗今天去學校了，晚上10點才能回來。",
      "pinyin": "dàn shì lì lì jīn tiān qù xué xiào le wǎn shang shí diǎn cái néng huí lái",
      "english": "I bought the movie tickets yesterday."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "因为我们的电影是8点的，所以我们不能看电影了。",
      "traditional": "因為我們的電影是8點的，所以我們不能看電影了。",
      "pinyin": "yīn wèi wǒ men de diàn yǐng shì bā diǎn de suǒ yǐ wǒ men bù néng kàn diàn yǐng le",
      "english": "But Lili went to school today, and couldn’t come back before 10 in the evening."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "我不太高兴。",
      "traditional": "我不太高興。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ bú tài gāo xìng",
      "english": "Because the movie was at 8 o’clock, we weren’t able to see it."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "丽丽和我说“对不起”，我说“没关系”。",
      "traditional": "麗麗和我說“對不起”，我說“沒關係”。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì hé wǒ shuō duì bu qǐ wǒ shuō méi guān xi",
      "english": "I’m not too happy."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili said “I’m sorry” to me. I said “That’s alright”."
    }
  ],
